{"parse": {"title": "山麓的回音-05a", "pageid": 135157, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-04\" title=\"山麓的回音-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">山麓的回音-05a</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B1%B1%E9%BA%93%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%9E%E9%9F%B3-05b\" title=\"山麓的回音-05b\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">山麓的回音</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">结局Ⅰ</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E2.80.9C.E5.BE.80.E7.BB.B4.E4.B9.9F.E7.BA.B3.E2.80.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"“往维也纳”\">“往维也纳”</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> “往维也纳”</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\"></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"muwumenwai_ye\"><img alt=\"muwumenwai_ye\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/600px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/900px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9c/Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png/1200px-Cg-muwumenwai_ye.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在略微休整后，队员们分散进入了这座遗弃村落之中。重塑追随者的撤退得相当及时，仿佛对当前的景象早有预期。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>奇怪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>不知道自何时起，萦绕在耳旁的歌声已经消失不见了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这份久违的寂静光临时，竟然显得有些……格格不入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>是在刚刚的战斗之中消失的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许是吧，也只有这时，自己才有可能没有注意到它的变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>折返的埃米尔打断了塞梅尔维斯的思绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>队长！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>发现了什么线索吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>根据你的指示，我们在不远处发现了一处密室。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>密室内有着短暂停留的痕迹，重塑之手显然来过这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>带我过去吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gongmu.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gongmu\"><img alt=\"gongmu\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/600px-Cg-gongmu.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/900px-Cg-gongmu.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/Cg-gongmu.png/1200px-Cg-gongmu.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_xingzhengdating\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/3d/Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_xingzhengdating.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>根据神秘术的痕迹遗留，我们判断对方是在刚刚的战斗中被趁乱救走的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……还有其他人同样也在营救被囚禁者？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>原来如此……我们被那些难民利用了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>虽说如此，但塞梅尔维斯的脸上并未流露出不满的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是一间并不大的房间，仅有一扇小小的窗户与外界联通。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>房间内的装饰简朴，值得注意的地方不多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯很快注意到桌子上面的信封。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这是……一封信？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>是重塑之手留给我的，亦或是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>——那位被囚禁者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>想要获得这个问题的答案并不困难，只需要拆开这封信，便可获得答案。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯伸出手，自桌面上拿起书信。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>边角的墨迹并未干涸，这意味着对方刚离开不久。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>信件并不长，只有寥寥几行字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但塞梅尔维斯却来回的将它反反复复的阅读了好几遍，试图寻找出什么线索。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这是……某种幻觉吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>——不，这不是幻觉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>倘若这就是幻觉，未免太过于真实和难以置信了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯深吸了一口气，将自己内心中的激动之情压抑住，以防止身旁的埃米尔看出端倪。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"dubaiyongheiping\"><img alt=\"dubaiyongheiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/600px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/900px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/03/Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png/1200px-Cg-dubaiyongheiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\"><img alt=\"1_5_bg_jiaotang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/600px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/900px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png/1200px-Cg-1_5_bg_jiaotang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她重新一字一句的审视起了这封信件。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“你好，不知名的来者。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“我有办法治愈你的疾病，让你活下去。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“是的，我有能够让你在转变为神秘学家感染种的感染过程中存活的办法。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“请在维也纳寻找到我。届时，你将获得救赎，战胜不洁。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在书信的下方，附上了署名。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"623901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"623901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-623901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-623901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>——莱茵河的罗蕾莱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她究竟是谁？她是从而得知自己的真实身份的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>自己最大的秘密，竟被如此轻易的放置在墨点之上，就像是一张任人品评的简短菜单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无数的疑问萦绕在塞梅尔维斯的脑海之中，打的她措手不及。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对于学者而言，神秘学家感染种这个名词太过宽泛，它囊括了不计其数的失败者与寥寥无几的幸存者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因此，在神秘学界中，对于这种几乎专属于神秘学家的疾病，有一种更为精准、更为触及本质的称呼方式。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——超自然者感染征。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这便是塞梅尔维斯所染上的疾病的真正名称。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaosushe\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaosushe\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"xuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2c/HeadIconSmall-624301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">埃米尔：</div><div>队长，你怎么了吗？你似乎盯着这封信件看了很久。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这封信内涉及到了某些机密信息，我准备将它转交给基金会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯平静的从背带上摘下了通讯设备，打开了与琳赛女士的通讯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>见状，埃米尔也并未多问，自觉地离开了房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>塞梅尔维斯，任务完成的怎么样了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>一切顺利，琳赛女士。我正要向您汇报具体情况，我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>不，这些汇报可以延后进行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>现在有一则更为重要的紧急任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>维也纳的霍夫曼调查员向委外人才管理组织提出了援助需求。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>很遗憾，其他的小队目前均无法脱身，无法及时抵达维也纳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>维也纳……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"xuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“请在维也纳寻找到我。届时，你将获得救赎，战胜不洁。”</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaosushe\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaosushe\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c2/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaosushe.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"xuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"xuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/eb/Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-xuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我明白了。我手头上还有两张“转念即至”的神秘术软盘，它能够帮助我快速抵达维也纳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>我向你许诺，这是你在这个时代的最后一个任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"624401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"624401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/HeadIconSmall-624401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-624401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">琳赛女士：</div><div>等你回归时，医疗部门将会与你重新谈论你的病症。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>琳赛女士，霍夫曼也是我的朋友，能够帮助她是我的幸运。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>结束通讯后，塞梅尔维斯将通讯设备重新放回了背包——就如同她先前无数次所做的一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>“莱茵河的罗蕾莱”……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——塞梅尔维斯喃喃自语着，望向了维也纳所在的方位。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>这也是……命运吗？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "山麓的回音-05a"}}